An intelligent sorting tool that automatically separates your spicy content from your safe-for-work media. 
Powered by machine learning, nude-split scans your photo library and cleanly splits nudes from non-nudes — no more awkward surprises in your camera roll or gallery.
Keep your secrets safe, and your scrolls safe-for-work.

 a nudity scanner based on: https://sites.google.com/a/dcs.upd.edu.ph/csp-proceedings/Home/pcsc-2005/AI4.pdf?attredirects=0

  The detection algorithm An Algorithm for Nudity Detection

by R. Ap-Apid

an algorithm for detecting nudity in color
images. with A skin color distribution model based on the RGB,
Normalized RGB, and HSV color spaces

The skin color model is
used to identify and locate skin regions in an image

These
regions are analyzed for clues indicating nudity or nonnudity

The Nudity Detection
Algorithm is able to detect nudity with a 94.77%